# Time, events and the journal (DESIGN.md §2, §11). Every accepted command becomes numbered,
# time-stamped events; every command, refused ones included, goes in the journal.
load content/sample
advance 5
advance 3
assert time == tick 8
assert advance 0 == error: ticks must be at least 1
events
assert events --since 1 == #2 at tick 5: time advanced from 5 to 8
journal
